&lt;li&gt;CapCut, Canva &amp;amp; Co. kennst du in- und auswendig, und Übergänge, Untertitel und Schnitte auf den Beat bekommst du ohne Anleitung hin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instagram, TikTok und LinkedIn sind dein Zuhause, du scrollst mit Creator-Blick und probierst neue Trends gern als Erste:r aus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eingeschrieben bist du in Medienproduktion, Mediendesign, Kommunikation, Marketing oder einem vergleichbaren Studiengang&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ob Videos, eigene Accounts oder Projekte: Deine Arbeiten möchtest du uns am liebsten sofort zeigen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du: &lt;strong&gt;#teamplayer #openminded #proaktiv #kreativ&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Introduction&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Mechanical and Biomedical Engineering department is looking for an engineer with strong practical and analytical skills.  Working predominantly across healthcare projects, you will use your engineering skills at all stages of the development life-cycle.  You will take responsibility for design challenges and technical problems, participating in concept generation, research, design and testing.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Successful candidates can join us between May - October 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW97298115 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW97298115 BCX8&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. Once the position is filled, we will close the advert. We encourage you to apply as soon as possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW97298115 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW97298115 BCX8&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW97298115 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will work within a team of highly talented, supportive and multi-disciplinary engineers on major development projects, applying your practical and analytical abilities to realise novel medical technologies for our clients around the globe. You will participate in projects covering all stages of the development life-cycle, applying novel technologies in the field of medical device development.  You will have the opportunity to create exciting cutting-edge technology in areas such as diagnostics, drug delivery, surgical and acute care, synthetic biology and digital health.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be using your strong technical and interpersonal skills to make a significant contribution to development projects, from initial concepts through to final delivery. This will include: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Concept generation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Analysis and development of engineering designs  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Rapid Prototyping &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design and implementation of test rigs &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design and execution of experimental test programmes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Presenting results, both internally and to clients &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Preparing technical reports and producing high-quality documentation &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you can bring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re looking for applicants who can demonstrate:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;652&quot;&gt;An excellent academic record, studying for or having completed a relevant Engineering degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;655&quot; data-end=&quot;731&quot;&gt;A solid understanding of core engineering fundamentals and physical principles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;734&quot; data-end=&quot;809&quot;&gt;A genuine enthusiasm for tackling real-world problems through engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;890&quot;&gt;A creative and analytical approach to problem-solving and concept generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;892&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;In addition, experience in any of the following areas would be advantageous (but not essential):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;994&quot; data-end=&quot;1118&quot;&gt;Familiarity with engineering tools such as Python/MATLAB and 3D CAD software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1121&quot; data-end=&quot;1215&quot;&gt;Understanding of engineering analysis tools used in product development, such as CFD and FEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1218&quot; data-end=&quot;1261&quot;&gt;Relevant industrial or project experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1264&quot; data-end=&quot;1325&quot;&gt;Strong practical and hands-on mechanical engineering skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1389&quot;&gt;An interest in applying engineering to the biomedical field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Please ensure your CV includes your A Level (or equivalent) subjects and grades, as well as any relevant university modules and gained or predicted grades.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Covering statements are recomended for this role.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Inside Account Executive is a key member of the EMEIA sales team, helping existing customers and channel partners understand how they can make the management and the security of their Apple devices robust and easy. The role works with the extended sales team to hit individual targets as well as contributing to the overall MEA sales goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role is offered as hybrid, with the expectation to be in the office in London (7–10 Chandos Street, London W1G 9DQ) 3 days per week. We are only able to accept applications for those based in the UK and have sponsorship to live and work in the UK #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you can expect to do this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate regularly with a defined list of existing accounts throughout the year to identify areas of need for business growth and new solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own on-time renewal for your entire SMB customer portfolio; consistently meet or exceed retention rate targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively engage customers 90–120 days ahead of renewal to understand health, flag risks, and secure commitment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer business needs and schedule technical demonstrations or face to face meetings with SE as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and qualify upsell and cross-sell opportunities within the existing customer base by aligning Jamf solutions to customer business needs and industry insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute campaigns to drive traffic to online and in-person events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter new Opportunities and related information into SalesForce.com to document and manage sales activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop well-rounded understanding of JAMF sales&amp;nbsp;philosophy, market and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to position JAMF Software solutions against competitor offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately process customer transactions such as price quotations and purchase orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow understanding of and ability to explain business value of JAMF Software solutions to prospects and existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for leading and closing sales opportunities for the Strategic Commercial team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performs all job responsibilities in alignment with the core values,&amp;nbsp;mission and purpose of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adheres to the highest moral, ethical and legal standards to deliver an environment that promotes respect, innovation and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports and promotes a positive, inclusive workplace one in which the talents and strengths of our increasingly diverse workforce are welcomed, further developed and manifested in our work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English is required and Arabic is preferred but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2+ years of experience in a sales, business or entrepreneurial role (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience selling in both direct and indirect (channel) models (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience navigating and negotiating legal agreements (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General Experience in software sales within high-growth technology companies (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and coordinate well with other team members that are remote&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interact effectively with prospects and customers via phone and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance areas of responsibility across multiple territories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10% travelling expected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Jamf?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2025 Best Companies to Work For by U.S. News.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2025 Newsweek America’s Greatest Workplaces for Gen Z&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named one of Forbes Most Trusted Companies in 2024&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2024 Newsweek America’s Greatest Workplaces for Parents &amp;amp; Families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;Named a 2024 PEOPLE Companies That Care by PEOPLE® and Great Place To Work®&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We offer a clear and defined sales career path. Our main goal is to help you successfully step into our Account Executive role, but there are many ways to advance your career at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We train and then we give you the room to grow. Our Jamfs can explore the vertical career path, as well as the horizontal, to discover new interests and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;You don’t have to be a techie to be a Jamf. Our best-in-class sales focused Bootcamp training provides you with the technical and product knowledge required to confidently talk with customers about Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;We set achievable targets, help each other out, and share best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;9313&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to make a real and meaningful impact for more than 75,000 global customers with the best Apple device management solution in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is a leading AI-powered performance marketing platform for the mobile app economy. Our end-to-end technology stack helps app marketers acquire and retain high-value users, while enabling publishers to maximize revenue across programmatic and direct demand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff’s solutions, including Accelerate, Direct, Monetize, Intelligence, and Vungle Exchange, support over 6,600 mobile businesses across 74 countries in sectors such as gaming, social, finance, ecommerce, and entertainment. Founded in 2012 and headquartered in Redwood City, CA, Liftoff has a diverse, global presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Liftoff is looking for a Commercial Legal Counsel that will assist the in-house legal department with Insertion Orders (Agreements), third party contracts and other legal needs. This position will support the Commercial, Finance and Accounting teams, located around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a Commercial Legal Counsel at Liftoff, you will play a pivotal role in ensuring the seamless execution of contracts that drive our business forward. You will be at the intersection of legal expertise, meticulous organization, and collaborative teamwork. Your responsibilities will encompass contract drafting, negotiation, process improvement and training. As an essential part of our team, you&#39;ll contribute to the foundation of our business relationships and help us navigate the complex world of contracts with precision and efficiency. If you&#39;re passionate about detail-oriented work, contract law, and making a meaningful impact, this role is your opportunity to shine. Join us in shaping the way we manage contracts and elevate our commitment to excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, review, and negotiate a wide range of contracts, including vendor agreements, customer contracts, and licensing agreements, to ensure compliance with company policies and legal requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal teams, including legal, sales/commercial, product, engineering, finance and accounting to understand contract terms, resolve issues, and provide guidance on contractual matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain an organized and up-to-date contract ticketing system, respond to each contract ticket in a timely manner and track contract milestones and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in&amp;nbsp; contract compliance, addressing any deviations or breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the development and improvement of contract templates and standard clauses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the contract approval process, ensuring proper authorization and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and training to employees on contract-related matters and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on relevant laws and regulations impacting contract management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-8 years&#39; PQE&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Law, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Contracts Counsel/Legal Counsel or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of contract law and legal terminology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with exceptional organizational and time management abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in contract management software or tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work collaboratively in a cross-functional team environment globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in ad-tech is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in London or remotely within the United Kingdom, occasionally going into the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is a contract position. The expected hours of work required for this position are 35 to 40 hours per week, with occasional early evening hours for team meetings, as the manager is located in our Redwood City office in California.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-NM1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Liftoff offers a fast-paced, collaborative, and innovative work environment where employees are empowered to grow and make an impact. We’re shaping the future of the mobile app ecosystem—join us and help accelerate what’s next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff’s compensation strategy includes competitive salaries, equity, and benefits designed to support employee well-being and performance. We benchmark compensation based on role, level, and location to ensure fairness and market alignment. Benefits may include medical coverage, wellness stipends, and additional perks based on your country of residence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liftoff is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees and applicants regardless of race, ethnicity, national origin, age, marital status, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, religion, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency and Third Party Recruiter Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Liftoff does not accept unsolicited resumes from individual recruiters or third-party recruiting agencies in response to job postings. No fee will be paid to third parties who submit unsolicited candidates directly to our hiring managers or Recruiting Team. All candidates must be submitted via our Applicant Tracking System by approved Liftoff vendors who have been expressly requested to make a submission by our Recruiting Team for a specific job opening. No placement fees will be paid to any firm unless such a request has been made by the Liftoff Recruiting Team and such a candidate was submitted to the Liftoff Recruiting Team via our Applicant Tracking System.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Jamf, we believe in an open, flexible culture based on respect and trust. Our track record and thriving work environment all stem from the freedom we grant ourselves to get the job done right. We take pride in helping tens of thousands of customers around the globe succeed with Apple.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The secret to our success lies in our connectivity, while operating with a high degree of flexibility. Work-life balance remains our priority while feeling connected is important to maintain our strong culture, achieve our goals, and thrive as #OneJamf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do at Jamf:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise New Logo Account Executive MEA &lt;/strong&gt;is a results-driven hunter responsible for identifying, pursuing, and closing new enterprise logos for Jamf. Focused exclusively on net-new acquisition within the enterprise segment (organizations with 1,000+ employees), this role requires strong prospecting discipline, the ability to manage complex multi-stakeholder sales cycles, and the consultative acumen to position Jamf&#39;s Apple Enterprise Management solutions at the executive level. Success in this role is defined by consistent pipeline generation, new logo attainment, and laying the foundation for long-term customer partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is offered in &lt;strong&gt;The Netherlands only&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably for candidates located in the Randstad and used to travel to MEA&amp;nbsp;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you can expect to do this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Logo Prospecting &amp;amp; Pipeline Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a targeted outbound prospecting motion to identify and engage net-new enterprise accounts within an assigned segment or territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop segment fluency — understanding buyer personas, common objections, industry-specific compliance needs, and Apple ecosystem maturity within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing, Business Development, and Channel partners to execute coordinated account-based prospecting that feeds a healthy, qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain consistent pipeline coverage and hygiene, ensuring sufficient volume and stage diversity to meet and exceed quota targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales Cycle Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from initial outreach and discovery through proposal, negotiation, and close — navigating the complexity typical of enterprise buying processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and engage multiple stakeholders across IT, Security, Finance, Legal, Procurement, and executive leadership to build multi-threaded relationships within target accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply a structured qualification methodology (e.g., MEDDPICC) to assess deal health, prioritize effort, and improve forecast accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate enterprise procurement processes, including security reviews, DPAs, and SLAs, with support from Jamf Legal and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver compelling business cases, demonstrations, and ROI presentations tailored to the priorities of diverse buying audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Deal Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure initial commercial agreements that are competitive, value-aligned, and appropriately sized to facilitate a strong land — with long-term expansion in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate contract terms with support from Jamf Legal and Finance, maintaining deal momentum while protecting Jamf&#39;s commercial interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain competitive positioning in deals where incumbents or alternatives are present; articulate Jamf&#39;s differentiated value with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Ecosystem Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build productive working relationships with Apple&#39;s enterprise sales team and Jamf&#39;s channel and reseller partners to generate introductions and support deal execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage partner resources appropriately to accelerate pipeline and strengthen account access, especially within named accounts or complex organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forecasting, Reporting &amp;amp; Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate, up-to-date records in Salesforce, including account activity, pipeline stage, and deal notes, to support individual and team forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consistent, reliable monthly and quarterly forecasts, with clear visibility into deal status and expected close timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share learnings from the field — win/loss patterns, competitive intelligence, objection themes — to contribute to team and segment knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of B2B SaaS or technology sales experience with a demonstrated track record of meeting or exceeding quota (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional working proficiency in English is required and Arabic is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex enterprise sales cycles involving multiple stakeholders, including IT and executive-level buyers (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to generate pipeline through outbound prospecting, partner engagement, and marketing collaboration (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with a structured sales qualification methodology (e.g., MEDDPICC, MEDDIC, SPIN) and ability to apply it to assess deal health (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work effectively in both direct and indirect (channel/partner) selling models (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills; able to deliver clear and persuasive presentations to technical and business audiences (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Salesforce or equivalent CRM for pipeline tracking, forecasting, and activity documentation (Required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative, solutions-oriented selling approach with the ability to connect technology to business outcomes (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Apple enterprise ecosystem, endpoint management, or SaaS security solutions (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating enterprise procurement processes including DPAs, SLAs, and security reviews (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed and resilient; able to manage long sales cycles and ambiguous buying processes with discipline and focus (Preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel in the MEA territory around 40%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY AND PRIVACY REQUIREMENTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;markedContent&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in ongoing security training is mandatory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established security protocols will be adhered to, sensitive data will be handled responsibly, and data protection practices are followed, including understanding relevant privacy regulations and reporting breaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acknowledging the Jamf Code of Conduct, where applicable security and privacy policies can be found, is a requirement of all roles at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Why Jamf?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Named a Fortune Best Workplace for Millennials, 2021.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We offer a clear and defined sales career path. Our main goal is to help you successfully step into our Account Executive role, but there are many ways to advance your career at Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We train and then we give you the room to grow. Our Jamfs can explore the vertical career path, as well as the horizontal, to discover new interests and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You don’t have to be a techie to be a Jamf. Our best-in-class sales focused Bootcamp training provides you with the technical and product knowledge required to confidently talk with customers about Jamf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We set achievable targets, help each other out, and share best practices across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to make a real and meaningful impact for more than 70,000 global customers with the best Apple device management solution in the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We put people over profits – which is why our customers keep coming back to us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;We encourage you to simply be you. We constantly seek and value different perspectives to ensure Jamf is a place where everyone feels comfortable and can be successful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;23 of 25 world’s most valuable brands rely on Jamf to do their best work (as ranked by Forbes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What it means to be a Jamf?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We are a team of free-thinkers, can-doers, and problem-crushers. We value humility and the relentless pursuit of knowledge. Our culture flows from a spirit of selflessness and relentless self-improvement - driving both personal growth and collective progress throughout our company. We unite around common goals while respecting personal approaches, believing that fulfilled individuals create a thriving, vibrant workplace.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is simple: hire exceptionally good people who are incredibly good at what they do and let them do it. We provide the support and resources to let everyone be their authentic, best selves at work, at rest, and at play. We are committed to supporting the continual improvement of Apple in the workplace, the organizations that rely on them and the people who keep it all running smoothly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above it all, waves our banner of #OneJamf – and the knowledge that when we stand together, we accomplish so much more than we could alone. We seek individuals who share this unwavering journey toward growth to join us in our quest for constant improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does Jamf do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Jamf extends the legendary Apple experience people enjoy in their personal lives to the workplace. We believe the experience of using a device at work or school should feel the same, and be as secure as, using a personal device.&amp;nbsp;With Jamf, customers are able to confidently automate Mac, iPad, iPhone and Apple TV deployment, management, and security – anytime, anywhere – to protect the data and applications used by employees in the workplace, students learning in the classroom, and streamline communications in healthcare between patients and providers.&amp;nbsp;More than 2,500 Jamf strong worldwide, we are free-thinkers, can-doers, and problems crushers who are encouraged to bring their whole selves to work each and every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get social with us and follow the conversation at #OneJamf&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Jamf is committed to creating an inclusive &amp;amp; supportive work environment for all candidates and employees. Candidates with disabilities or religious beliefs are encouraged to reach out if they need additional support or alternative options to our recruiting processes to accommodate their disability or religious belief. If you need an accommodation, please contact your Recruiter or Recruiting Coordinator directly. Requests for accommodation will be handled confidentially by Recruiting and will not be shared with the hiring manager. Jamf is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate against individuals who request reasonable accommodation for disability or religious beliefs. To request accommodations please email us at &lt;a ----------
