&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Xometry (NASDAQ: XMTR) powers the industries of today and tomorrow by connecting the people with big ideas to the manufacturers who can bring them to life. Xometry’s digital marketplace gives manufacturers the critical resources they need to grow their business while also making it easy for buyers at Fortune 1000 companies to tap into global manufacturing capacity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To strengthen our Finance team in Europe, we are looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;General Ledger Accountant&lt;/strong&gt; to support accounting operations for our France entity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparation of monthly and annual financial statements and daily accounting activities under local standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of SOX work with the decentralized teams, HQ and audit companies, Further development of the internal control system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the consolidation of the Europe subgroup according to US Gaap (Sage Intacct)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordination of stakeholders (audit firms, tax consultants, lawyers) on accounting and sales tax issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development of internal reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account reconciliation and analysis of balance sheet/P&amp;amp;L accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in the optimization or (re)design of processes in the financial sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation and creation of process descriptions and work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project work in the financial sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years accounting experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of French Generally Accepted Accounting Principles (PCG / French GAAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in &lt;strong&gt;French and English&lt;/strong&gt; (written and spoken)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have gained experience in Finance with Big 4, management consulting or a start-up and have a university degree in finance, economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound knowledge of accounting software Intacct or other similar programme, common MS Office programs, especially Excel, preferably additional ERP experience, AI usage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on mentality, with the willingness to take over operational activities in day-to-day business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication skills are just as much a part of your strengths as result-oriented way of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position in a fast-growing international company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of responsibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flat hierarchies and fast decision-making processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International and supportive team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RSUs package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard working schedule: 40 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;France, Remote&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
